
# machine translated (Arabic), not yet reviewed by a person.

# Reason shown when a picture of a kind that cannot be turned is turned.
folders-imaging-no-turn = يستطيع Folders تدوير صور JPEG وPNG وWebP وBMP فقط

# Reason shown when a picture file could not be read for turning or resizing.
folders-imaging-unreadable = تعذّر على Folders قراءة الصورة

# Reason shown when a resized picture would have to be written in a kind Folders cannot write.
folders-imaging-no-write = لا يستطيع Folders حفظ هذا النوع من الصور

# Why a link to a picture is not turned.
folders-imaging-no-turn-link = هذا رابط، لذلك أدر الصورة التي يشير إليها بدلاً من ذلك

# Why a moving picture is not turned.
folders-imaging-no-turn-moving = لا يدير Folders الصور المتحركة، لأن الإطار الأول فقط كان سيبقى
